{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119516","id":3696842315,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7cWVZL","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119516","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119516.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119516.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119516","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119516/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119516/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119516/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2c5620580e79d288b2ec0bc1ed9e9d6201659cd8","number":119516,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix WASAPI capture stream rate setup","user":{"login":"puneetdixit200","id":236133619,"node_id":"U_kgDODhMc8w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/236133619?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetdixit200","html_url":"https://github.com/puneetdixit200","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetdixit200/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetdixit200/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetdixit200/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetdixit200/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetdixit200/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetdixit200/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetdixit200/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetdixit200/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetdixit200/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\r\n  Fixes godotengine/godot#119498\r\n\r\n  ## Summary\r\n  - Keep WASAPI capture streams on the capture endpoint's mix rate.\r\n  - Avoid `AUDCLNT_STREAMFLAGS_RATEADJUST` for capture endpoints.\r\n  - Expose the actual WASAPI input mix rate through `get_input_mix_rate()`.\r\n  - Add unit coverage for capture vs render stream setup behavior.\r\n\r\n  ## Root cause\r\n  Godot initialized WASAPI capture streams with the configured output mix rate when it differed from the input endpoint\r\n  mix rate. That path also applied `AUDCLNT_STREAMFLAGS_RATEADJUST`, which Microsoft documents as valid only for\r\n  rendering devices. With SteelSeries Sonar active, this appears to produce correctly sized but silent capture buffers.\r\n\r\n  ## Testing\r\n  - `python misc\\scripts\\file_format.py drivers\\wasapi\\audio_driver_wasapi.cpp drivers\\wasapi\\audio_driver_wasapi.h\r\n  tests\\drivers\\test_audio_driver_wasapi.cpp`\r\n  - `git diff --check`\r\n  - Attempted Windows test build with `scons platform=windows target=editor tests=yes dev_build=yes accesskit=no\r\n  d3d12=no angle=no`, but local Windows SDK tools/headers are missing (`rc`, `windows.h`).\r\n\r\n  ## AI agent usage\r\n  - Used an AI coding agent to prepare this patch; I reviewed the changes and verification output.","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-05-17T08:59:01Z","updated_at":"2026-05-17T09:10:47Z","closed_at":"2026-05-17T09:10:42Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"8ff3c1dabcfd0fd00b6c9a564a03288bb16f03f2","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"puneetdixit200:codex/fix-wasapi-silent-capture","ref":"codex/fix-wasapi-silent-capture","repo":{"id":1241320793,"node_id":"R_kgDOSf0NWQ","name":"godot","full_name":"punee